{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/562168c3ee4735f6cb524d2ea9cc78d8.avif?t=1771860714\" width=1280 height=208 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/678981a5a0e116bfc3f95f8adc68006c.poster.avif?t=1771860714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/678981a5a0e116bfc3f95f8adc68006c.webm?t=1771860714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/678981a5a0e116bfc3f95f8adc68006c.mp4?t=1771860714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Eva, a young apprentice minstrel, on her mission to save her village\u2019s joy in Trimeria - The Thief of Smiles. This graphic adventure invites you to explore a magical world, face unique challenges, and unravel the mystery of the demon threatening to steal all smiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with charming characters, solve intriguing puzzles, and develop minstrel skills that will make all the difference in this exciting story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/0aa9f858a7bd80495a3929dc047d3622.avif?t=1771860714\" width=1280 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story to Remember:</strong> Experience a narrative blending humor, tragedy, and deep emotions as you help Eva find her place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Secrets:</strong> Explore the grandfather\u2019s house, the vibrant village, and the mysterious outskirts, with each setting brimming with details and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minstrel Skills:</strong> Use juggling, music, and storytelling to overcome obstacles and connect with the game\u2019s characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting Visual Style:</strong> Enjoy vibrant, captivating art that brings every corner of Trimeria to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundtrack:</strong> Let yourself be carried away by an original score that complements the experience and enhances every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for this unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/617230514df83037976f988aaefa3313.poster.avif?t=1771860714\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/617230514df83037976f988aaefa3313.webm?t=1771860714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/617230514df83037976f988aaefa3313.mp4?t=1771860714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/extras/54ab4abc5f11ad2e29914aa8dd69b0a4.avif?t=1771860714\" width=1280 height=391 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405080?t=1771860714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771860714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405080/7125246437f816eea6f9901b66be07f897f4d0c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=